WEBVTT

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.990
Isami-san's featured prominently again this month.

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:09.840
She's so beautiful.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:14.220
Welcome, everyone. I made tea.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.890
Thank you, Isami.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.080
Alice!

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:24.350
This barley tea has a ton of salt in it!

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.470
Oh, whoops.

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:28.730
I mistook the salt for sugar.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.620
That'd still be wrong!

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.410
Oopsie.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:35.120
Did she do it on purpose?

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.920
We are talking about Isa-nee here...

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:37.990
It wasn't on purpose.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.690
You see, my older sister is...

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:13.760
Isa-nee's in a slump, huh?

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:16.630
Episode 5
Come Play with
Your Older Sister

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:17.100
But she looks no different in her photos.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.590
I guess even Isami-san
gets depressed sometimes.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:22.220
She's human too, after all.

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:26.650
No, to me, Isami-san is a great, heavenly
being, far beyond anyone's reach!

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:28.980
I picture her eating mist!

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:31.520
Does she seem <i>that</i> otherworldly?

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:35.780
Onee-chan has been spacing out
a lot lately. I'm worried.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:39.590
When you're feeling down,
you should get out and have fun!

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:40.690
You're right.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:42.280
That's the best solution.

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:44.280
Go out with you guys?

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:48.080
Sure, I don't have any plans today.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.540
All right!

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.470
I'll change into my street clothes.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:56.420
Isa-nee, shouldn't you disguise yourself
with sunglasses or something?

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:00.380
Like camouflage?

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.930
That's too much of a disguise!

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:03.680
Well...

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.840
Usually, I just wear a hat,

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:09.410
but maybe I'll try a disguise today.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.310
Give me a minute.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.820
Thanks for waiting.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.880
Princess Shino!

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:24.480
Alice, where'd you get that camera?

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.300
Isami gave it to me.

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.570
I thought I'd take a bunch of pictures today.

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:29.710
Sounds cool.

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:33.460
I got cameras for everyone
from my older sister's collection.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:36.460
Let's each try to take our best photo ever today.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.820
That's great! You look cute!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.720
You can photograph objects or people.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.970
Alice is determined to snap her masterpiece!

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:49.000
There's even a cash prize for the winner!

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.930
Hey, now. Don't go overboard.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.190
It's okay.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.410
Alice and I have been saving up.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:56.480
Saving up?

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.840
I'd like to go to England again.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.820
But you don't have the money.

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:05.060
I know!

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:07.900
Let's start saving so we can go on a trip!

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:09.240
Good idea.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.750
Bank

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:11.750
We'll try to save ten yen a day.

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:14.560
Saving, saving.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.380
It feels like we're a long way off.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:18.060
If we use that money...

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.120
Don't!

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:21.450
We haven't saved that much, anyway!

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:22.890
Hey, Shinobu.

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:28.180
If you stand out that much,
my disguise will be pointless.

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:29.770
Shino's uniform?!

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.330
This is such a fresh feeling.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:41.390
<i>She really came out dressed like that...</i>

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:43.370
Onee-chan!

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.600
You forgot your camera.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.250
Oh, thanks.

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:54.850
She usually takes it with
her when she goes out.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:55.720
Yeah...

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:10.610
Wow, it's so big!

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:12.710
We'll have lots of fun here!

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:16.060
Don't forget to take pictures, everyone.

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:18.230
Yeah! Let's take some pictures!

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:20.550
Of what, though?

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:23.010
Maybe I'll take one of your smile.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.070
Come on, smile.

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.560
I want to see you smile.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:29.070
Wha—

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:32.440
Come on. You like cheesy lines like that.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:35.250
No! You're making fun of me!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.270
I wanna protect your smile!

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.330
Is that you, Kuzehashi-sensei?

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:51.360
Kujou-san?!

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.140
You're not wearing a suit. How unusual.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.770
Did you come here to have fun, too?

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:58.270
I just came to shop.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:01.470
You're so cute in casual clothes.

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:02.940
I'm surprised you wear miniskirts.

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:05.280
Hey... Why are you taking pictures?

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.560
For money.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.530
What does that mean? Explain yourself!

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.230
Huh? Where's Karen?

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:17.920
I did it!

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:21.920
I got some great shots!

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.860
Let's try the other floors.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.940
I-Isa-nee!

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:29.430
What?

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.260
It's the other side. That one's going up.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:33.850
Oh, whoops.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.100
This is serious...

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:50.730
Isami.

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:51.390
Huh?

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:53.080
Let's take some pictures together.

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:58.290
I don't want to be photographed right now...

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:01.360
Don't worry. It'll make you look beautiful.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:02.710
Really?

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:04.090
Please touch the screen

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:05.210
Close-up

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:05.210
Full Body

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:05.210
Full Body From Above

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:09.200
Here we go.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.780
Three, two, one...

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.770
With Isami      With Isami      With Isami

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:26.660
This shows how humans
will look after they evolve!

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.990
You'll be beautiful in the future too, Isami!

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:31.990
It's true! I promise it's true!

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.990
<i>She's trying to soften the blow...</i>

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:41.020
That wasn't much fun at all...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.650
We're just getting started.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:46.270
Isami-san will cheer up when
we visit some more stores.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.630
Let's check out some other places!

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.140
Wow, they're so colorful.

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:07.720
Has anything caught your eye, Onee-chan?

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:08.320
Huh?

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.280
Well...

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:18.680
It looks kind of strange, doesn't it?

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.170
Glasses on glasses!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.300
How cute!

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:30.920
I like that one.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:33.990
Isami, the ferrets are cute, aren't they?

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:36.030
Huh? Yeah, they are.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:39.600
But it looks like they're not cracking
shells on their tummies today.

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:41.660
That's otters!

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:43.980
Good boy.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.730
There, there.

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:51.180
Isami doesn't seem to be having much fun.

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:53.240
Should we go look at clothes?

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.930
She sees lots of clothes at work.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.490
Then I guess that won't cheer her up.

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:09.630
I know! Let's go there!

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.260
Ta-da!

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:13.880
I'm sure we'll have fun here!

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:15.720
How?

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.220
It's simple.

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:18.020
England

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:21.060
Look at the pamphlets, close your eyes,

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.600
and you can go anywhere in the world.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:31.530
All these pamphlets are the latest versions!

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:35.110
This is awesome!

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:41.240
What are you going to do with that many?

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:43.500
One trip a day...

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:46.940
This should last me a few months!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.590
Are you okay?

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:53.260
You can hardly walk.

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:55.420
I'm okay.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:59.590
With these, I can travel all I want for a while.

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:01.010
Shino!

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:02.260
Shinobu!

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:08.940
Onee-chan...

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:12.170
Be more careful.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:13.920
You're causing trouble for the store.

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.440
Put them all back.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.070
O-Okay!

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.940
Honestly, Shinobu's hopeless.

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:24.130
She needs me.

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:26.270
Isami!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.520
She looks like her usual self again.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.980
She's back to normal.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.710
Way to go, Shino!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:38.770
Onee-chan.

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:46.230
Now, let's go have lots more fun.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:47.770
Okay.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:54.700
Shinobu.

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:56.860
Can I have some?

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.690
Sure, here.

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:01.700
How does it taste?

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.620
It's delicious.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.630
We're back!

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.640
We got lots of pictures.

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:26.820
There are a lot of Shino, Aya, and Kusshi-chan.

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:29.140
Wait, why are there pictures of Kusshi-chan?

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:31.930
It's time to announce the results.

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:33.530
The winner is...

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:39.030
My older sister, who caught all
of us with our eyes closed!

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:43.710
Was this a funny photo contest?

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.130
What are you looking at, Isami?

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:49.910
Shinobu's...

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:54.840
Onee-chan, you're just looking at photos of me!

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.790
But they're so funny.

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:58.920
Sheesh...

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:00.920
Shinobu...

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:04.390
Alice...

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:08.540
Aya-chan, Youko-chan, Karen-chan...

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.700
Thanks for today.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:12.940
I had fun.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:14.900
Onee-chan...

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:17.680
V-Very much!

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:20.690
That's not the correct response.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.680
Look at this!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.790
My older sister's on the cover

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:34.830
of another new magazine issue!

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:38.030
Wow!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.630
I'm glad she's feeling better.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:45.590
I think she's even more beautiful than before.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.300
She's a goddess now.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.100
Our goddess has descended.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:53.350
A goddess? That sounds like a great omen!

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:57.360
We thank you. We thank you.

00:12:58.270 --> 00:12:58.860
Oh?

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:01.250
We thank you.

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:03.170
Are you playing a game?

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:07.490
Karasuma-sensei! Let me show you something!

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:15.570
Kuzehashi-sensei,

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:18.360
you're a different person on weekends.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.730
Karen-san showed me some photos.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:24.010
Kujou-san!

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:28.820
Hand over the film!

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:30.640
S-Sensei!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.560
My camera's digital, so it has no film.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:36.020
Don't nitpick!

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:40.070
Hello!!
Kin-iro Mosaic

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:44.000
Hello!!
Kin-iro Mosaic

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:46.000
The Straw Millionaire

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:50.560
I love Japanese fairy tales.

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:54.240
<i>The Straw Millionaire</i> is such a fun story.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:58.870
He started with a single stalk of
straw and ended up with a mansion.

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:08.070
I could really be a billionaire someday...

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:11.790
Alice, what are you reading?

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:18.390
There's gold in not just her
hair, but her eyes, too!

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:20.400
Not actual gold, but money, at least.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.930
I had no idea you felt so impoverished.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:24.080
I'm sorry.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:24.980
I don't!

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.780
I'm grateful to you and your family!

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:32.560
I see. <i>The Straw Millionaire,</i> huh?

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:36.020
Would you like to try it?
I'll be your first customer.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:37.800
I can't.

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:40.870
Everything you give me is a treasure.

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:42.070
But...

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:45.590
Ultimately, I should acquire a huge treasure,

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.720
so let's split it, okay?

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:49.430
I look forward to it.

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:53.240
Alice, your face...

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.710
With me?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:58.340
That depends on what you've got to trade.

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:00.110
I'm starting with these.

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:03.450
They fit in your hand, and they're
great for boys and girls of all ages.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:04.840
They're terrifying!

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:07.340
Well...

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.860
I'll give you this, then.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:13.980
Make sure you see Aya-chan next.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.190
Good luck.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.300
I'll be rich by the time I come home.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.610
What are you two scheming?

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.400
The Straw Millionaire?

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:27.990
Oh, like the fairy tale.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.460
Will you trade something for this?

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:31.510
A photo?

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:38.180
I-I can go as high as a thousand...

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:40.390
Aya, you can't use cash!

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:41.240
Baby Animals

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:43.710
Baby Animals

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.710
Can I give you this book, then?

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:46.790
Hooray! Thanks!

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:50.810
Stare...

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.220
Did you want that photo of Youko that badly?

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:55.850
Of course not! That makes
me sound like a pervert!

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:59.480
I'm just happy to have a picture of the two
of us together, since I don't have many!

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:01.660
Wait, that's not what I meant, either!

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:03.330
Uh-huh.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.970
What's with that knowing look?

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:08.320
A trade?

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.990
Yes, please.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:14.290
<i>This seems a bit too friendly for
a teacher-student relationship.</i>

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:16.000
<i>I should scold her...</i>

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.250
Ba-dump

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:20.050
I have nothing to trade.

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:21.750
It can be anything.

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:25.810
<i>Hmm... What's something a student would want?</i>

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:27.760
Class credits?

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.050
Sensei?!

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:31.250
What are you talking about?

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:35.930
Karasuma-sensei, what are you wearing?

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:38.140
I thought it would suit Alice-san.

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.850
Put this on, too.

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:45.730
You're so cute!

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:48.650
Huh?

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:53.870
I think the value is actually dropping now...

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.660
What's that? It's awesome!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:17:00.360
That's really nice. Where'd you get that?

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:01.590
It's cool!

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:04.450
You could use it as a hat in winter,

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:06.300
so it's practical, too.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.540
Youko...

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:10.320
You can have it.

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:12.370
Seriously? All right!

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:15.370
The Straw Millionaire, huh?

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:17.880
So I'll have to give you something in return.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.440
Here.

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:22.080
Is this water?

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:23.940
And it's tap water...

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.760
That's no ordinary water!

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:27.440
My energy's in there, too!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.570
I call it "Youko Water"!

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:31.810
What should I do?

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:33.670
The value keeps dropping lower.

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:34.830
You're so mean!

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:37.990
It seemed to be going so well at first.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:40.010
This is hard.

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:48.380
It's really warm again today.

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:51.360
They're still selling the bean soup drink?

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:52.910
Karen!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:58.090
Hey, Alice. I heard you're—

00:17:58.990 --> 00:17:59.900
Karen!

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:00.970
Karen-chan!

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.280
I-I'm choking...

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:03.570
Hang in there!

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:05.730
I know! Water! Have some water!

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:10.610
I'm glad I happened to
have some water on me.

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.220
Are you okay?

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:17.620
I feel better.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:21.120
So it's true that you're strawing it up.

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:22.820
"Strawing it up"?

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:25.130
It means trying to become a Straw Millionaire.

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:28.080
Someday, you might even
learn how to transform!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.880
Karen, I don't know what
you're talking about.

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:37.360
A-Are you girls royalty or something?

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:39.190
Of course not!

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:43.800
You're Alice-chan, right?

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:46.240
Shinobu-chan told me about you.

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:48.650
You don't have your halo today.

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:50.920
<i>What has Shino been telling her?</i>

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.630
Nice to meet you, um...

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:55.030
Matsubara Honoka.

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:56.340
Call me Honoka.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:59.540
Okay. Honoka it is, then.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.330
Okay! I'll trade with you!

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.600
Hooray.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:06.500
Since your family's rich, I'm sure...

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:10.460
Is something wrong?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:15.720
A ring? I-It's a real treasure!

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:18.040
It's not that valuable.

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.830
Oh, really?

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:20.810
It was only 10,000 yen.

00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:22.490
What? 10,000?!

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:23.850
Your family really is rich!

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.970
Karen, you have no concept of monetary value!

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.030
10,000 yen is a lot of money
for a high school student!

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:32.360
I can't accept something so valuable!

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:35.760
But I don't have anything else to trade.

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:37.770
Wh-What about some blonde hair?

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:40.300
I don't need that! I already have that!

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.030
Bye-bye.

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:46.620
See you tomorrow.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.360
<i>I wonder if it was right to take this...</i>

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:50.730
Alice!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.870
Youko!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:54.600
Let's go home!

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:58.810
Youko-chan, that's a cute hat.

00:19:59.110 --> 00:19:59.890
Isn't it?

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:03.000
It's embarrassing. Take it off.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.530
Want to try it on?

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:05.890
No!

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:08.400
See you tomorrow!

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:10.120
Bye-bye.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:10.120
See you tomorrow.

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:16.560
See you tomorrow.

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:17.480
Later.

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.510
Okay, see you tomorrow.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:28.130
By the way, how did your
Straw Millionaire trades go?

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:30.540
Well...

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.690
My father has a safe at home!

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:37.460
You can put it in—

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.110
Calm down, Shino!

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:45.430
I can't believe I got something
this valuable so easily...

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:48.590
I should be happy, but I just feel guilty.

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:51.220
The ring brought me emptiness...

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:57.610
This story taught me the joylessness

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:00.800
of acquiring valuable items with no effort.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:01.920
Alice...

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:05.690
<i>That's not what </i>The Straw Millionaire<i> is about!</i>

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:08.210
Oh, wow!

00:21:08.710 --> 00:21:09.880
Isami.

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:12.210
Hey, let's trade again.

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:15.460
But there can't possibly be
something more valuable...

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:19.980
I'll give you Shinobu.

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:20.470
Huh?

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:25.000
Nothing could be more valuable!

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:26.920
Oh, Alice.

00:23:03.340 --> 00:23:05.950
Promise you won't peek...

00:23:06.540 --> 00:23:07.640
Shino?

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:09.950
<i>What is she doing in there?</i>

00:23:11.060 --> 00:23:14.210
You can't hide anything from me, Shinobu!

00:23:15.470 --> 00:23:19.330
You found out that I'm secretly
making clothes for Alice!

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:20.590
Ba-dump

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:20.590
Shino...

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:23.850
You look great in that uniform.

00:23:23.850 --> 00:23:27.150
Since you're sisters, you might
look like Shino if you put a wig on!

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:28.250
How do I look?

00:23:28.250 --> 00:23:29.780
It's adult Shino!

00:23:29.780 --> 00:23:32.660
If Shino evolved, this is how she'd look!

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:33.600
Huh?!

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:33.600
Unevolved

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:36.060
The Girl on My Mind

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:35.690
See you later.
